<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Loraine Dec qtr gold profit up.</title>
<headline>Loraine Dec qtr gold profit up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gold profit				3.69  vs  2.91</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 0.84  vs  0.53</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			1,534  vs 1,601</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			 398,000  vs 381,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			   3.86  vs 4.20</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			 53,838  vs 52,958</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		    56,240  vs 54,779</p>
<p>Full name: Loraine Gold Mines Ltd , managed by Avgold Ltd, formerly gold mines managed by Anglovaal Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - Outstanding capital expenditure commitments at December 31, 1996 are estimated at 413,000 rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
